# Rust / Cargo
/target

# NOTE: Cargo.lock is intentionally committed. This crate builds a deployable
# artifact (the Soroban WASM), so builds must be reproducible. Leaving it
# uncommitted let fresh checkouts resolve soroban-env-host against an
# incompatible ed25519-dalek and fail to compile.

# Soroban build artifacts
*.wasm

# Environment
.env
